Two failures in my extra battery (demo itself is green). Both are about my own assumptions, and one is a real behavior bug worth fixing: the unquoted-identifier fallback was also applying to the left side, so `age != 30` with `age` missing returned True. The fallback should only apply to right-hand values. The other failure is my battery using `AGE` as a field name; field lookup stays case-sensitive (record keys are exact), only keywords are case-insensitive.
apply patch
